// Clue Name :
"P3874002795" "Old Bones"
// DetailString :
"P371033812" "You've found a pile of old bones. What's odd about it is the pieces of rusted armor you found with it. The armor looks ancient Greek or Roman in origin."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RomanTablets 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P3251646530" "Ancient Tablets"
// DetailString :
"P3305249386" "You look over the stone carvings and try and make sense out of them...<br><br>You can't make out any of the words, but of the few pictures carved into the stone you see something that looks like a tree or a multiple branching river. The river ends in six streams with a word carved next to it. However, one of the streams is crossed out. The word next to that stream or branch is called <color deepskyblue>Caelestis</color>."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - StarrHair 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P464785879" "A Locket of Starr Hair"
// DetailString :
"P1166697221" "You've collected a short locket of hair from an Arachnos agent named <color deepskyblue>Starr</color>. Darrin Wade claims to be able to use this to actually track down the killers of this man."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - KadabraKillDefeated 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1213184603" "Kadabra Kill"
// DetailString :
"P164616120" "One of the Heroes you unintentionally rescued from the Rikti told you this before you beat him into unconsiousness<br><br><color LightSeaGreen>'...you fool. Don't you see what the Rikti are doing to us? You think this is about fencing some stolen relics?<br><br>Open your eyes and realize that if the Rikti can stop magic once and for all... you'll have no one to buy your stolen goods.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - RiktiMagicAbusers 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P1546966614" "Sti'Lin's final words..."
// DetailString :
"P3940721364" "Sti'Lin told you just before he died that the Rikti are going to eliminate magic from your world...<br><br><color LightSeaGreen>Too Long: Rikti have waited. Too Long: Have we not exploited, humans: greatest weakness. Magic is power: Rikti are masters of all power. Your path shall end: Rikti technology prevail."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - AncientRelic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue Name :
"P763786156" "Cimeroran Relic"
// DetailString :
"P3443087476" "You've collected an old relic from within some ancient caves. Just before you let Alistair McKnight go, he told you that these relics are a road map to the history of super powers.<br><br>Perhaps, Darrin Wade would give you some money for it."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Clue - PassPhrase 
