// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P1098159773" "Hello, {HeroName}. Some of my old friends are poking their noses around the Isles. I'd prefer them to not do that. I've got business here and the <color orange>Midnight Squad</color> is bad for it. <br><br>Are you up for making sure they get the message and get out of town?"
// AcceptString :
"P376042739" "Clear out the Midnight Squad"
// SendOffString :
"P381115333" "Great. My spies tell me the Midnighter Club has enlisted the help of two heroes, <color red>Kadabra Kill</color> and his wife, <color red>Sigil</color>. They're trying to track down some relics uncovered here on the Isle. Beyond the fact that by definition, relics are old, I don't know what they are or why the Midnighters would want them.<br><br><color orange>Go have a 'chat' with these two heroes. If you happen to find what they're looking for and bring it back to me all the better.</color>"
// ActiveTaskString :
"P3086904131" "Take out two Midnighters"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P1559918427" "What are you waiting for, {Hero}? The relics aren't getting any older, but I am. The job's simple enough:<br><br><color orange>Run the Midnighters out of town and bring me back what they were after.</color><br><br>You may run into some other groups besides the Midnight Squad there. Odds are that if I've heard about this, someone else has as well."
// TaskTitle :
"P4271203795" "<color deepskyblue>Midnight Draws Near</color>"
// TaskSubTitle :
"P2770291627" "<color deepskyblue>Part One</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// MissionDef 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// EntryString :
"P2892244430" "Darrin Wade wants what the Midnighters are after. Looks like you'll have to bust some heads to get it.<br><br>Just another day in the Isles."
// Script Variable PATROLLER1_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
"P3861744812" "What are we doing here?"
// Script Variable PATROLLER2_SEARCHING_DIALOG :
