// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P165464571" "{HeroName}, something's come up. Something personal.<br><br>A business partner of mine has been killed. I want to know who did it. I can track down his killers, but I need a locket of his hair to do it."
// AcceptString :
"P1232324872" "Collect a locket of hair"
// SendOffString :
"P3047708224" "Thank you. My old partner, <color deepskyblue>Starr</color>, was a member of Arachnos. He always said it helped him pay the bills, when his thaumaturgy couldn't. Anyway, they're keeping his body there. <color orange>I need you to break in and get the hair sample.</color><br><br>With the hair sample I can work some magic and track the killers back to their point of origin."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1677890588" "Collect Starr Hair Sample"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P40459747" "You still need to get into that Arachnos base and get a sample from my old partner. Without it I can't find his killers. If I can't find his killers, I'm not going to be able to focus on other matters."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P437020894" "<color deepskyblue>Part Two</color>"

