"P839429060" "You've exacted revenge on Starr's killers and collected some useful knowledge for Darrin Wade along the way."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P572679096" "The Rikti killed Starr? But wait, what?<br><br> They were trying to extract his magical essence. That's what they were doing with all those other magical beings.<br><br>I bet the Rikti are getting a little tired of having their butts kicked by the magic we've got on our world. Odds are, they're looking at a way to shut that down. Interesting... <br><br>Thanks for taking care of that personal matter of mine. Now we can get back down to business."

