// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P3307832896" "On that last mission you ran into <color red>Sigil</color> and <color red>Kadabra Kill</color> again, didn't you? <br><br>I guess the Midnight Squad is involved in more ways than one. I think it's time we paid the Midnighters a visit."
// AcceptString :
"P1365952110" "Agree to pay them a visit."
// SendOffString :
"P139643233" "Before I can get you into their little club, we're going to have to get past security. To do this, <color orange>you're going to have to question a Midnighter and get another hair sample for me.</color> I'll mix you up a potion that will make you look like him. With that and the pass phrase you should be able to get into the Midnighter Club."
// ActiveTaskString :
"P1046760604" "Get Midnighter Hair Sample"
// YoureStillBusyString :
"P4060136937" "You still need to get that hair sample of the Midnighter for me. He's doing some work in an old cave around here. You think these guys would be more clandestine with their activities."
