// Dialog :
"P3039842367" "You've questioned the Midnighter and gotten his hair sample. You've also found an old relic that Darrin might be interested in. You should have everything you need for Darrin Wade to get you into the Midnighter Club."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog :
"P2370935177" "What have we here? An ancient Cimeroran Tablet. Excellent work, {Hero}. I haven't seen one of these preserved this nicely since... well, since I used to be a Midnighter myself.<br><br>Perhaps we can use this to our advantage. With the locket of hair and this relic, we should have everything I need to infiltrate their club house.<br><br><color orange>Hope you remember the pass phrase.</color>"

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Reward - ReturnSuccess 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task - Mission5 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Dialog - DialogTree 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Page DisguiseActive Text :
"P777547286" "Hey, dad, good to see you again. I know you're you and all, but I have to ask you the pass phrase anyway."
// Answer Text :
"P1694062556" "Answer question"
// Answer Text :
"P4060782435" "Leave"
// Page Question Text :
"P2841215516" "So, what's the pass phrase, dad?"
// Answer Text :
"P1913293383" "Quando Omni Flunkus Moritati"
// Answer Text :
"P3875922597" "Si vis pacem, para bellum"
// Answer Text :
"P2184241356" "Alea jacta est"
// Page RightAnswer Text :
"P1375085957" "I know it's silly but there you go.<br><br>Anyway, you can take that relic  around back. But you know that don't you? See you later."
// Page WrongAnswer Text :
"P3206368644" "Dad, come on. I know you know this. Are you just testing me to see if I'll call for backup or something? Let's try this again."
// Answer Text :
"P2772953370" "Try again"
// Page DisguiseNotActive Text :
"P1921213224" "Hello, stranger. I'm really sorry I can't talk right now. I'm waiting for my father to show up. He's supposed to be here with a new relic... Hehe. New relic, that's funny.<br><br>Anyway, as you can see, I'm a little busy. Oh, and if you see my dad, he's a tall guy, red hair, wears a bowler, tell him I'm waiting over here for him.<br><br>Thanks."

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Task Header Items 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// IntroString :
"P105996779" "It's time for you to see how the other half lives, {HeroName}. You should have the potion that will turn you into a reasonable looking member of the Midnight Club. I call it <color orange>The Midnight Visage</color>.<br><br>The relic you found will help us as well. This will allow you to circumvent the front door and get you in through the back. Let's go over the plan one more time."
// AcceptString :
"P2076441363" "Go over the plan"
// SendOffString :
"P3819660080" "Head over to Cap Au Diable and give <color deepskyblue>Ashley McKnight</color> the pass phrase. She's on front door duty and you have to talk to her, even though you're not going in the front door. Once you give her the phrase, she'll send you around back.<br><br>When you get inside, I'm going to want you to steal... I mean replace everything you can in there.<br><br>Be careful though, because... and I really should have mentioned this earlier, <color orange>the Midnighter you're going to transform into is Ashley's Dad.</color> But that could work to your advantage on getting in."
// TaskSubTitle :
"P1224468182" "<color deepskyblue>Finale</color>"

